{"team":"SEA","col":"#69BE28","identity":"balanced","funnel":"balanced-D","plays_pg":59.5,"adot":7.5,"report_html":"<div class=\"report\"><h2>No Fixed Address</h2><p>There's no bell-cow to bank on \u2014 the lead back sees just <strong>50%</strong> of carries (league ~59%), a committee that caps any one back's ceiling and makes their rushing props matchup- and script-dependent.</p><h3>The Offensive Blueprint</h3><p>In the passing game the ball funnels to <strong>Jaxon Smith-Njigba</strong> \u2014 <strong>29% of targets</strong> (league ~23%), a genuine alpha share that concentrates the receiving value at the top.</p><p>The WR2 is unusually involved here \u2014 <strong>18%</strong> of targets (league ~15%), meaning there's bankable volume beyond the top receiver.</p><p>They're a heavy under-center team (61% shotgun vs ~68%) \u2014 a pro-style, run-committed structure.</p><p>When they fall behind they abandon the run entirely \u2014 59% pass while trailing, so their pass-catchers have huge comeback-script ceilings.</p><h3>In the Red Zone</h3><p>Inside the 20 they lean run-heavy, passing <strong>47%</strong> of the time, funnelling touchdown equity to <strong>Jadarian Price</strong>.</p><h2>Defense \u2014 A Balanced Defense</h2><p>They lock down opposing WR1s \u2014 just 48 rec yds/game (vs ~58); fade receiving props there.</p><p><strong>Soft against opposing tight ends</strong> \u2014 42 rec yds/game (vs ~35). A rec-yards target.</p><p>They surrender <strong>106 rushing</strong> and <strong>226 passing</strong> yards per game (league ~120 / ~230). No dominant funnel \u2014 read it matchup by matchup.</p><p>A stingy, efficient defense \u2014 just 42% success allowed (vs ~44%); temper expectations for opposing skill players.</p><h2>The Betting Angles</h2><p>Bottom line: their pass-catchers have massive ceilings in comeback scripts (fade-material as underdogs).</p><p><em>Built on 2024\u201325 data; the profile rebuilds through the season as the current staff and roster set their own tendencies.</em></p></div>","depth":{"QB":[{"name":"Sam Darnold","slot":"QB1","starter":true,"td":10,"props":{"Comp":18.39,"Att":28.73,"Pass Yds":217.77,"Pass TD":1.43,"INT":0.65,"Rush Yds":8.41},"d":{"completions":18.39,"attempts":28.73,"pass_yards":217.77,"pass_td":1.43,"interceptions":0.65,"rush_att":2.36,"rush_yards":8.41}}],"RB":[{"name":"Jadarian Price","slot":"RB1","starter":true,"td":28,"props":{"Rush Att":16.48,"Rush Yds":71.02,"Tgt":3.49,"Rec":2.77,"Rec Yds":19.77},"d":{"rush_att":16.48,"rush_yards":71.02,"targets":3.49,"receptions":2.77,"rec_yards":19.77,"rec_td":0.08}},{"name":"George Holani","slot":"RB2","starter":true,"td":15,"props":{"Rush Att":4.2,"Rush Yds":15.4,"Tgt":2.65,"Rec":1.81,"Rec Yds":13.06},"d":{"rush_att":4.2,"rush_yards":15.4,"targets":2.65,"receptions":1.81,"rec_yards":13.06,"rec_td":0.05}},{"name":"Emanuel Wilson","slot":"RB3","starter":false,"td":20,"props":{"Rush Att":7.52,"Rush Yds":33.47,"Tgt":2.37,"Rec":1.59,"Rec Yds":10.33},"d":{"rush_att":7.52,"rush_yards":33.47,"targets":2.37,"receptions":1.59,"rec_yards":10.33,"rec_td":0.04}}],"WR":[{"name":"Jaxon Smith-Njigba","slot":"WR1","starter":true,"td":33,"props":{"Tgt":12.29,"Rec":8.87,"Rec Yds":110.53,"Rec TD":0.42},"d":{"targets":12.29,"receptions":8.87,"rec_yards":110.53,"rec_td":0.42}},{"name":"Rashid Shaheed","slot":"WR2","starter":true,"td":12,"props":{"Tgt":4.45,"Rec":2.84,"Rec Yds":41.1,"Rec TD":0.13},"d":{"targets":4.45,"receptions":2.84,"rec_yards":41.1,"rec_td":0.13}},{"name":"Cooper Kupp","slot":"WR3","starter":true,"td":29,"props":{"Tgt":8.56,"Rec":6.16,"Rec Yds":75.86,"Rec TD":0.35},"d":{"targets":8.56,"receptions":6.16,"rec_yards":75.86,"rec_td":0.35}}],"TE":[{"name":"AJ Barner","slot":"TE1","starter":true,"td":24,"props":{"Tgt":4.81,"Rec":3.75,"Rec Yds":35.31,"Rec TD":0.26},"d":{"targets":4.81,"receptions":3.75,"rec_yards":35.31,"rec_td":0.26}},{"name":"Eric Saubert","slot":"TE2","starter":false,"td":12,"props":{"Tgt":4.05,"Rec":2.4,"Rec Yds":19.85,"Rec TD